{"unit_id": "openLabBean__dsh-digital-pet#card-zh", "repo": "openLabBean/dsh-digital-pet", "commit": "fc0a7db04011dcfe60552b8996be97fbe20f4462", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "DSH Digital Pet 是运行在 DeepSeek Harness Web 界面中的电子宠物插件，在设置页提供领养与状态管理，并以悬浮层显示宠物。它支持九种宠物、成长阶段、喂食洗澡散步等照护、金币商店、托管和纪念册；有效 Token 用量可兑换金币。适合希望在工作区获得轻量互动陪伴的 DSH 用户，存档按本地 profile 保存。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client.js:1", "index.js:10"]}
{"unit_id": "openLabBean__dsh-digital-pet#card-en", "repo": "openLabBean/dsh-digital-pet", "commit": "fc0a7db04011dcfe60552b8996be97fbe20f4462", "type": "card", "lang": "en", "text": "DSH Digital Pet is a companion plugin for the DeepSeek Harness web interface, with an adoption page and floating pet. Raise one of nine species through growth stages, provide daily care, earn coins from eligible token usage, and keep memorial records. Saves are stored per local profile.", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client.js:1", "index.js:10"]}
