{"unit_id": "openLabBean__dsh-digital-pet#feature-3", "repo": "openLabBean/dsh-digital-pet", "commit": "fc0a7db04011dcfe60552b8996be97fbe20f4462", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "DSH Digital Pet 的功能「Token 换金币」：Host 从 DSH 消息事件读取有效 Token 用量，按配置比例及每日上限记入金币账本，供用户购买宠物食品。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:331", "index.js:361"]}
